{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfs2rsLT9gGBfmRPfkj5W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The root cause was `dedupe_rows` in `reporting/dedupe.py`. It tracked seen event IDs in a list and checked each row with `r.event_id in seen_ids`. That scan is linear, so the whole pass was quadratic. The output was still correct, which matches the ticket, but the cost grew with the square of the row count.\n\n**Fix** (`reporting/dedupe.py`): `seen_ids` is now a `set`. The output list still keeps first-occurrence order, so the result is unchanged. `build_report` on 30k rows went from 4.5s to 0.01s in my benchmark. The ticket's hour-long run is presumably the same growth at production row sizes, but I didn't have their data to confirm that.\n\n**Regression tests** (`tests/test_report.py`):\n- `test_dedupe_is_linear_not_quadratic` counts `__eq__` calls on the event IDs instead of timing the run, so it doesn't flake. The old code makes about 4.5M comparisons at n=3000, and the test requires at most n. I ran it against the old `dedupe.py` and it failed (449xxxxx comparisons), then passed on the fix.\n- `test_dedupe_keeps_first_occurrence_order` pins the ordering behavior the old code had.\n\n**Test suite:** `python3 -m pytest` runs 3 tests, all passing: the original `test_small_report` plus the two new ones.\n\nI didn't touch the public API or any other module. Nothing is committed. Running pytest rewrote the tracked `.pyc` files under `reporting/__pycache__` and `tests/__pycache__`, so they show as modified; you may want to exclude them from the commit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10804,"cache_read_input_tokens":54386,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10804},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54523f15-7a55-40d7-a1a3-2f5d4f3a68a2","uuid":"e3ee0d37-073d-4ee1-af5d-b9c00d6b86b7","timestamp":"2026-10-09T17:09:35.048Z","request_id":"req_011Cfs2rreHb63h8ufFUNoLL"}
